  "question": {
    "text": "In a nuclear fission reaction of an isotope of mass <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>M</mi></math>, three similar daughter nuclei of same mass are formed. The speed of a daughter nuclei in terms of mass defect <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Δ</mi><mi>M</mi></math> will be :"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msqrt><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>c</mi><mi>Δ</mi><mi>M</mi></mrow><mi>M</mi></mfrac></msqrt></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>Δ</mi><mi>M</mi><msup><mi>c</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>c</mi><msqrt><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>Δ</mi><mi>M</mi></mrow><mi>M</mi></mfrac></msqrt></math>",
      "is_correct": true
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>c</mi><msqrt><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>Δ</mi><mi>M</mi></mrow><mi>M</mi></mfrac></msqrt></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    }
  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "C"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>Let the reaction be, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>→</mo><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">X</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>+</mo><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Y</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>+</mo><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Z</mi><mo>)</mo></math></p><p>Let mass of each daughter nuclei be <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>m</mi></math>, then mass defect can be written as <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>∆</mo><mi>M</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>M</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>m</mi></math>.</p><p>Now the energy released will be in the form of kinetic energy of the daughter nuclei. Therefore, </p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Δ</mi><mi>M</mi><msup><mi>c</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi>m</mi><msup><mi>V</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi>m</mi><msup><mi>V</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi>m</mi><msup><mi>V</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace><mo>⇒</mo><mi>V</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>Δ</mi><mi>M</mi><msup><mi>c</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>m</mi></mrow></mfrac></msqrt><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>Δ</mi><mi>M</mi><msup><mi>c</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mrow><mi>M</mi><mo>-</mo><mo>∆</mo><mi>M</mi></mrow></mfrac></msqrt><mo>≈</mo><mi>c</mi><msqrt><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>Δ</mi><mi>M</mi></mrow><mi>M</mi></mfrac></msqrt></math></p></blockquote>"
  }
}